## Source findings and limits

`_copy_backend(::DenseLUBackend)` returns the same backend, so PFI copies share LU
numeric leaves. Container ownership is insufficient permission to mutate them.
Base BigFloat multiplication creates an ambient-precision result. Installed MA
1.8.1 uses the global MPFR rounding mode whereas Julia1.13 Base multiplication
consults scoped rounding first. The proposed constant-time equality predicate must
fallback before mutation when these differ. No rounding adjustment is allowed.

The installed two-argument triangular solve selects `istriu` and normalizes its
wrappers. Even a UnitLowerTriangular can take an upper branch on diagonal inputs.
The plan requires exact branch/order mapping including unit division and zero
products. There is no post-write fallback/retry, global method replacement or
fused operation. Unsupported shape/type/version uses the original route.

The prospective n16 boundary is fixed before measurement, not inferred as optimal.
One call-local product gives a source opportunity of n(n-1)-1 fewer temporary
product constructions for ordinary two-triangle paths. This does not count all
allocations or prove a speedup/native memory release. Subtraction and division
allocations remain. No full scan, persistent cache or additional solve is proposed.

